1
00:00:00,035 --> 00:00:02,224
This is my dad, he's great
这是我爸爸，他很棒

2
00:00:02,435 --> 00:00:04,783
He teaches me how to do crafts
他教我做手工

3
00:00:04,835 --> 00:00:07,274
We use paper, scissors, and glue
我们用纸剪刀和胶水

4
00:00:07,275 --> 00:00:09,119
We make animals, flowers
我们制造动物，花朵

5
00:00:09,119 --> 00:00:10,423
and other fun things
和其他有趣的东西

6
00:00:10,955 --> 00:00:12,864
My dad is very patient
我爸爸很有耐心

7
00:00:12,994 --> 00:00:15,183
He shows me each step slowly
他慢慢地向我展示每一步

8
00:00:15,275 --> 00:00:17,224
I love spending time with him
我喜欢和他在一起

9
00:00:17,475 --> 00:00:20,153
Making crafts with my dad is so much fun
和我爸爸一起做工艺品太有趣了

10
00:00:20,155 --> 00:00:21,762
I feel happy and proud
我感到高兴和自豪

